<title>USA: TABLE - Maytag Corp Q2 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Maytag Corp Q2 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Iowa 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.45		   $ 0.43</p>
<p> Net			 43,783		   44,343</p>
<p> Sales		    814,541		  754,619</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  97,785		  102,604</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
