<p> Net			 82,283		   60,461</p>
<p> Sales		  1,607,010		1,485,865</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  97,700		  103,667</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Maytag's China joint venture with Hefei Rongshida formed last fall reported second quarter sales of $26.3 million and operating income of $2.6 million and first half sales of $61.7 million  and operating income of $6.1 million.</p>
